# System Design Document
## Telugu Speech-to-Sign App

### 1. High-Level Architecture Diagram

```mermaid
graph TD
    User([User]) -->|Speaks Telugu| Mic[Microphone Input]
    Mic -->|Audio Wave| AudioProc[Audio Processor Module]
    AudioProc -->|Google Speech API| STT[Speech-to-Text Engine]
    STT -->|Telugu Text| NLP[NLP Translator Module]
    
    subgraph "NLP Translation Logic"
        NLP -->|Tokenize| Tokens[Tokens]
        Tokens --> Check{Direct Match?}
        Check -->|Yes| Map[Direct Mapping]
        Check -->|No| Bridge[English Bridge]
        Bridge -->|Translate| En[English Text]
        En -->|Fuzzy Match| Fuzzy[Sign Matcher]
    end
    
    Map --> SignSeq[Sign Sequence]
    Fuzzy --> SignSeq
    
    SignSeq -->|List of Signs| Animator[Corpus Animator Module]
    
    subgraph "Animation Rendering"
        Animator -->|Lookup| DB[(ISL Corpus Database)]
        DB -->|Frames| Cache[Frame Cache]
        Cache -->|Image Sequence| GUI[GUI Display]
    end
    
    GUI -->|Visual| User
```

### 2. Component Design

#### A. Frontend (Presentation Layer)
- **Technology**: `CustomTkinter` (Python)
- **Responsibility**: 
  - Capture User Input (Record Button)
  - Display Real-time Feedback (Recognized Text)
  - Render Animation (Canvas/Label updates)
- **Key Class**: [App](file:///c:/Users/iamav/Desktop/Claude%20Capstone/telugu_speech_to_sign/gui/app.py#33-658) in [gui/app.py](file:///c:/Users/iamav/Desktop/Claude%20Capstone/telugu_speech_to_sign/gui/app.py)

#### B. Backend (Logic Layer)
- **Audio Processor**:
  - Handles noise calibration and silence detection.
  - Wraps `speech_recognition` library.
- **NLP Translator**:
  - **Core Algo**: `Dictionary Lookup` + `Pivot Translation`.
  - **Data Structures**: Hash Maps (Python Dictionaries) for O(1) lookup of signs.
- **Animator**:
  - **Optimization**: Pre-loads directory paths to avoid disk I/O latency during playback.

### 3. Data Flow Design
1. **Input**: Real-time Audio Stream (16kHz, Mono).
2. **Processing**: output text -> JSON Object `{'telugu': '...', 'sign': '...', 'type': 'direct'}`.
3. **Output**: Series of JPEG images played at ~25 FPS.

### 4. Deployment Architecture
- **Environment**: Local Windows Machine (Python VirtualEnv).
- **External Dependencies**: Internet connection required for Google Speech & Translate APIs.
- **Local Dependencies**: ISL Corpus (Static Files).
